kind: cargo
description: |
  bindgen -- makes Rust bindings for C headers.  Only for building Buna
  Browser (docs/browser.md): Chromium's build runs it for the C libraries
  its Rust code calls (logging, HarfBuzz, Fontconfig, BoringSSL, ...).  It
  loads libclang at run time; base/chromium.bst points it at LLVM 23's.

build-depends:
- bootstrap/build-env.bst
- bootstrap/rust.bst

